From: Sobs <antohasobne@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] client: classic creature window

Ordinary stacks get the original game's creature window (CRSTKPU):
portrait, stats, morale/luck, three spell effect boxes in battle,
dismiss/upgrade/OK buttons and a status bar, as in SoD and HotA.
Commanders, several upgrades, stack experience and stack artifacts
keep VCMI's extended window.
---
